{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-agent-apis","title":"AI Agent 可调用的 API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/ai-agent-apis","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-agent-可调用的-api-设计\">AI Agent 可调用的 API 设计</h1><p>2026 年，API 的消费者不再只是前端应用和后端服务——AI Agent（LLM 驱动的自主程序）正在成为一类新的、行为模式完全不同的 API 消费者。Agent 通过 Function Calling / Tool Use 协议调用 API，它们&quot;阅读&quot;的是 JSON Schema 描述而非人类文档，它们的重试行为更激进、上下文窗口有限、对错误响应的解读能力依赖于描述的语义清晰度。为 Agent 设计 API 需要一套新的考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI Agent 调用 API 的流程与传统客户端有本质差异：Agent 不是按照硬编码逻辑调用固定端点，而是 LLM 根据用户意图、可用工具描述和对话上下文<strong>动态决策</strong>调用哪个端点、传什么参数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant L as LLM&#10;    participant T as Tool Registry&#10;    participant A as API Server&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;L: &quot;帮我查上周的订单&quot;&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;T: 查看可用工具定义&#10;    T-&gt;&gt;L: createOrder, getOrders, cancelOrder...&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;L: 决策: 调用 getOrders&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;A: GET /orders?created_after=2026-06-25&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;L: [orders...]&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;U: &quot;你上周有 3 个订单...&quot;\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant L as LLM\n    participant T as Tool Registry\n    participant A as API Server\n    U-&gt;&gt;L: \"帮我查上周的订单\"\n    L-&gt;&gt;T: 查看可用工具定义\n    T-&gt;&gt;L: createOrder, getOrders, cancelOrder...\n    L-&gt;&gt;L: 决策: 调用 getOrders\n    L-&gt;&gt;A: GET /orders?created_after=2026-06-25\n    A-&gt;&gt;L: [orders...]\n    L-&gt;&gt;U: \"你上周有 3 个订单...\"</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消费者类型</th>\n<th>发现 API</th>\n<th>理解参数</th>\n<th>错误处理</th>\n<th>重试行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前端应用</td>\n<td>编译时确定</td>\n<td>类型系统保证</td>\n<td>代码逻辑分支</td>\n<td>受控重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI Agent</td>\n<td>运行时从描述推断</td>\n<td>依赖语义描述</td>\n<td>依赖错误信息文本</td>\n<td>激进且不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方开发者</td>\n<td>阅读文档</td>\n<td>阅读文档 + 试错</td>\n<td>阅读错误文档</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"json-schema-作为工具定义\">JSON Schema 作为工具定义</h2><p>OpenAI、Anthropic、Google 的 Function Calling 协议都使用 JSON Schema 子集描述工具参数。这意味着 API 设计者写的 OpenAPI Schema 可以<strong>直接复用</strong>为 Agent 的工具定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;searchOrders&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;搜索用户的历史订单。支持按状态、日期范围、金额范围过滤。当用户询问订单相关问题时使用此工具。&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parameters&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;status&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;        &quot;enum&quot;: [&quot;pending&quot;, &quot;confirmed&quot;, &quot;shipped&quot;, &quot;delivered&quot;, &quot;cancelled&quot;],&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;按订单状态过滤。不传则返回所有状态的订单。&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;created_after&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;        &quot;format&quot;: &quot;date&quot;,&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;只返回此日期之后创建的订单。格式: YYYY-MM-DD&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;created_before&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;        &quot;format&quot;: &quot;date&quot;,&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;只返回此日期之前创建的订单。格式: YYYY-MM-DD&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;min_amount&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;number&quot;,&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;最低订单金额（人民币元）&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;required&quot;: []&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"searchOrders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"搜索用户的历史订单。支持按状态、日期范围、金额范围过滤。当用户询问订单相关问题时使用此工具。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"enum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"confirmed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shipped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delivered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cancelled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"按订单状态过滤。不传则返回所有状态的订单。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"created_after\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"只返回此日期之后创建的订单。格式: YYYY-MM-DD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"created_before\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"只返回此日期之前创建的订单。格式: YYYY-MM-DD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"最低订单金额（人民币元）\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"description-是-agent-的-文档\">description 是 Agent 的&quot;文档&quot;</h3><p>对人类开发者来说，参数名 <code>created_after</code> 加上类型 <code>date</code> 就够理解了。但对 LLM 来说，<code>description</code> 字段是它理解<strong>何时</strong>以及<strong>如何</strong>使用这个参数的唯一线索。</p>\n<p>优秀的工具 description 应该回答：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>What</strong> — 这个工具做什么？</li>\n<li><strong>When</strong> — 什么场景下应该使用它（而非其他工具）？</li>\n<li><strong>How</strong> — 参数之间的关系和约束是什么？</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 差 — LLM 不知道何时该用&#10;{ &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Get orders&quot; }&#10;&#10;// 好 — 明确告诉 LLM 使用条件&#10;{ &quot;description&quot;: &quot;搜索用户的历史订单。当用户询问过去的购买记录、订单状态、物流进度时使用。不要用于创建新订单。&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 差 — LLM 不知道何时该用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Get orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 好 — 明确告诉 LLM 使用条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"搜索用户的历史订单。当用户询问过去的购买记录、订单状态、物流进度时使用。不要用于创建新订单。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"为-agent-优化的响应设计\">为 Agent 优化的响应设计</h2><h3 id=\"结构化且扁平的响应\">结构化且扁平的响应</h3><p>LLM 处理深层嵌套 JSON 时容易丢失信息。Agent 友好的响应应该尽量扁平化关键信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// Agent 不友好 — 关键信息藏在深层嵌套&#10;{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;metadata&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;timestamps&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;created&quot;: &quot;2026-06-28&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Agent 友好 — 关键信息在顶层&#10;{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;ord_123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;shipped&quot;,&#10;  &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2026-06-28&quot;,&#10;  &quot;total_amount&quot;: &quot;299.00 CNY&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tracking_number&quot;: &quot;SF1234567890&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Agent 不友好 — 关键信息藏在深层嵌套</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"metadata\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"timestamps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-28\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Agent 友好 — 关键信息在顶层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ord_123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shipped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"299.00 CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tracking_number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SF1234567890\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"人可读的值格式\">人可读的值格式</h3><p>Agent 需要向用户转述 API 返回的数据。让值本身就是人可读的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计决策</th>\n<th>不友好</th>\n<th>友好</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金额</td>\n<td><code>29900</code>（分）</td>\n<td><code>&quot;299.00 CNY&quot;</code> 或 <code>{ &quot;amount&quot;: 299.00, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot; }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td><code>1719936000</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;2026-07-02T12:00:00Z&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td><code>3</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;shipped&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td><code>&quot;PYMT_CXL&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;payment_cancelled&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"响应中嵌入行动提示\">响应中嵌入行动提示</h3><p>告诉 Agent &quot;下一步可以做什么&quot;，减少它需要推理的步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;ord_123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;pending&quot;,&#10;  &quot;available_actions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;cancel&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;取消此订单（仅在发货前可取消）&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;update_address&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;修改收货地址&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ord_123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"available_actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cancel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"取消此订单（仅在发货前可取消）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"update_address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"修改收货地址\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"安全边界-限制-agent-的能力\">安全边界：限制 Agent 的能力</h2><p>AI Agent 可能被 Prompt Injection 攻击操纵，因此 API 对 Agent 的暴露需要额外的安全层：</p>\n<h3 id=\"只读优先\">只读优先</h3><p>默认只暴露读取操作给 Agent，写操作需要人工确认（Human-in-the-loop）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tools&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;getOrders&quot;, &quot;requires_confirmation&quot;: false },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;cancelOrder&quot;, &quot;requires_confirmation&quot;: true }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tools\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"getOrders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requires_confirmation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cancelOrder\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requires_confirmation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"操作范围限制\">操作范围限制</h3><p>Agent 使用的 API Key 应该有最窄的 scope 和最严格的速率限制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;key_type&quot;: &quot;agent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scopes&quot;: [&quot;orders:read&quot;, &quot;products:read&quot;],&#10;  &quot;rate_limit&quot;: 100,&#10;  &quot;max_cost_per_call&quot;: &quot;$0.01&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"key_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scopes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders:read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"products:read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rate_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"max_cost_per_call\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$0.01\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"审计日志\">审计日志</h3><p>所有 Agent 的 API 调用都应记录完整审计日志，包括触发 Agent 的原始用户 prompt（脱敏后），便于事后追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcp-model-context-protocol-与标准化\">MCP（Model Context Protocol）与标准化</h2><p>2026 年 Anthropic 推出的 MCP 协议正在成为 Agent 调用外部工具的标准化尝试。MCP 定义了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工具发现（Agent 如何知道有哪些工具可用）</li>\n<li>工具调用（参数传递与响应格式）</li>\n<li>权限协商（Agent 能调用哪些工具）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这意味着 API 设计者未来可能需要同时维护 OpenAPI Spec（给人类开发者）和 MCP Tool Definition（给 Agent）——或者找到两者的统一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AI Agent 是一类行为模式不同的 API 消费者：依赖语义描述、重试激进、上下文有限</li>\n<li>JSON Schema 的 <code>description</code> 字段是 Agent 的&quot;文档&quot;——必须回答 what/when/how</li>\n<li>响应设计应扁平化关键信息、使用人可读值格式、嵌入可执行动作提示</li>\n<li>安全设计：只读优先、最窄 scope、人工确认写操作、完整审计日志</li>\n<li>MCP 协议正在标准化 Agent 与工具的交互方式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"docs-sdk-generation\">文档生成与 SDK 工程</a> — 从 OpenAPI Spec 到 Agent Tool Definition 的复用路径</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/frontend-security-engineering/engineering/dependency-supply-chain\">前端安全：依赖与供应链安全</a> — Agent 作为 API 消费者的供应链安全考量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI Agent 可调用的 API 设计","id":"ai-agent-可调用的-api-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON Schema 作为工具定义","id":"json-schema-作为工具定义"},{"level":3,"text":"description 是 Agent 的\"文档\"","id":"description-是-agent-的-文档"},{"level":2,"text":"为 Agent 优化的响应设计","id":"为-agent-优化的响应设计"},{"level":3,"text":"结构化且扁平的响应","id":"结构化且扁平的响应"},{"level":3,"text":"人可读的值格式","id":"人可读的值格式"},{"level":3,"text":"响应中嵌入行动提示","id":"响应中嵌入行动提示"},{"level":2,"text":"安全边界：限制 Agent 的能力","id":"安全边界-限制-agent-的能力"},{"level":3,"text":"只读优先","id":"只读优先"},{"level":3,"text":"操作范围限制","id":"操作范围限制"},{"level":3,"text":"审计日志","id":"审计日志"},{"level":2,"text":"MCP（Model Context Protocol）与标准化","id":"mcp-model-context-protocol-与标准化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"文档生成与 SDK 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/docs-sdk-generation"},"next":{"title":"API 版本策略与兼容性演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/versioning-compatibility"}}